


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_1189b849:


    "祥子和圣夜子并排走在站前通道上。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_8d1912f7:



    voice "2SA_0492"
    sachiko "「抱歉啊，让你帮我提」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_78e427d0:



    voice "2MI_0608"
    miyako "「没事，毕竟是我擅自跟过来的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_884611b4:


    "与十分内疚的祥子相对，圣夜子一直微笑着。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_4e8ccf70:


    "两个人都提着西点屋的购物袋。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_fc510fd7:


    "袋子里面是情人节巧克力。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_ad375d59:



    voice "2SA_0493"
    sachiko "「果然买了好多啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_6ed252a7:



    voice "2MI_0609"
    miyako "「要送给住宿舍的大家吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_645906f0:



    voice "2SA_0494"
    sachiko "「每年大家都会给我，真令人高兴。所以我也至少要回赠一个才行啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_97f06f4f:



    voice "2MI_0610"
    miyako "「还礼不应该是在白色情人节吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_11643dfc:



    voice "2SA_0495"
    sachiko "「白色情人节也会收巧克力、赠巧克力哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_aa49e701:



    voice "2MI_0611"
    miyako "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_7d6beff9:



    voice "2SA_0496"
    sachiko "「在女校很常见哦。把巧克力包装好互相交换，大家都很喜欢这个行为本身。所以，开心的活动当然是越多越好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_a0733088:



    voice "2MI_0612"
    miyako "「原来如此」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_db5015e2:



    voice "2SA_0497"
    sachiko "「那群孩子开心的话，我也乐意奉陪哦♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_f680819f:



    voice "2SA_0498"
    sachiko "「……话又说回来，人家是一群而我是一个人。从支出的角度来说有些严峻就是了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_375dae27:



    voice "2MI_0613"
    miyako "「啊哈哈……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_8937df25:


    "巧克力装满了四个手提袋。确实不算便宜啊。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_0c517736:



    voice "2MI_0614"
    miyako "「说起来为什么没在文的店里买呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_962b3ba5:



    voice "2SA_0499"
    sachiko "「因为也要送给文文啊。想着如果收到自己家的商品可能不会那么高兴」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_2f2e5ee9:



    voice "2MI_0615"
    miyako "「啊，原来如此」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_90ac4d88:



    voice "2SA_0500"
    sachiko "「不过如果因为店里的销量上升而零花钱变多的话好像也不错」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_49905809:


    "祥子笑了笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_0c3cd146:



    voice "2MI_0616"
    miyako "「巧克力也有我的份吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_1e798f55:


    "圣夜子偷偷地观察着祥子的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_03f50952:



    voice "2SA_0501"
    sachiko "「有喔。反正你肯定也会被文邀请去买或者做巧克力」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_df266ca6:



    voice "2MI_0617"
    miyako "「是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_3447c0ee:



    voice "2SA_0502"
    sachiko "「嗯，绝对会」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_0060c449:



    voice "2MI_0618"
    miyako "「那样的话我也可以参加巧克力交换了呢。开始期待情人节了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_629b0025:



    voice "2SA_0503"
    sachiko "「虽然交换巧克力不是情人节原本的活动就是了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_da1d3523:



    voice "2MI_0619"
    miyako "「送礼物和接受礼物两边都能体验，不是很棒吗♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_35f9fa89:


    "这么说着的圣夜子一边甩着购物袋一边大步的向前走。像是在跳着一样。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_7d87a35a:



    voice "2SA_0504"
    sachiko "「喂喂，要是那样甩的话！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_41f48bbf:



    voice "2MI_0620"
    miyako "「嗯？怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_7a335fb7:



    voice "2SA_0505"
    sachiko "「所以说，袋子里会一团糟……的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_229020ac:


    "祥子停下脚步，看向回望过来的圣夜子，像被光线晃到了似的，微微地眯起了眼。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_a29193e1:



    voice "2MI_0621"
    miyako "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_9355fb68:



    voice "2SA_0506"
    sachiko "「……你啊，是为了什么来到这边的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_61e5798e:


    "难以想象的认真表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_834bf0c6:



    voice "2MI_0622"
    miyako "「因为你邀请了我唷？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_e1db4781:


    "面对脱离话题的疑问，圣夜子的表情显得有些恍惚。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_5f2ba003:



    voice "2SA_0507"
    sachiko "「只是这样？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_4830d255:



    voice "2MI_0623"
    miyako "「因为在她们三人的房间中观察，我变得向往人类，觉得就算要舍弃双翼也是值得的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_4c08bd6d:



    voice "2MI_0624"
    miyako "「但那是因为你把自己欣赏的她们介绍给我，果然你才是契机」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_fa858c2e:



    voice "2SA_0508"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_a8983763:



    voice "2MI_0625"
    miyako "「那一天，如果你没有在屋顶和我搭话的话，我现在依然还在某处飞翔着吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_2627e9a9:


    "没有一丝不安的微笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_3e62aefc:



    voice "2SA_0509"
    sachiko "「那算是偶然？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_58e9c38c:



    voice "2MI_0626"
    miyako "「我是这么想的。毕竟那一天是我第一次飞到这片区域」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_46efe1b6:



    voice "2SA_0510"
    sachiko "「……也是啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_32aa686f:


    "祥子的表情多了几分柔和。不知是释然了，还是决定释然了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_29eb0e4e:



    voice "2MI_0627"
    miyako "「你是为了什么向我发出了邀请呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_17c9e6c9:



    voice "2SA_0511"
    sachiko "「之前也问过这个啊。都说了那个是不知不觉——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_809fc8c9:



    voice "2SA_0512"
    sachiko "「不对，可能是太冷了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_fb0b5635:


    "这次又自嘲了起来。真是忙碌啊。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_1c72ccf4:



    voice "2MI_0628"
    miyako "「……冷？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_e8935845:



    voice "2SA_0513"
    sachiko "「对不起啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_93f41767:



    voice "2MI_0629"
    miyako "「……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_9c694005:


    "圣夜子因为不知道祥子为什么道歉而愣住了。这也难怪。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_ad031f5b:


    "祥子忽然快步地走了起来，从圣夜子的身旁径直地穿了过去。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_e18d6207:



    voice "2MI_0630"
    miyako "「……！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_e3f9696e:


    "圣夜子小跑着追了上去，"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_139d4244:



    voice "2SA_0514"
    sachiko "「……喔？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_061fd93a:


    "——挽住了祥子的手。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_a8bf3554:



    voice "2MI_0631"
    miyako "「因为很冷啊♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_788a5560:



    voice "2SA_0515"
    sachiko "「……你真暖和啊。困了吗？」"




translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_fd4a79a7:


    voice "2SA_0496"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_05_02ebfb45:


    sachiko "「在女校很常见哦。把巧克力包装好互相交换，大家都很喜欢这个行为本身。所以，开心的活动当然是越多越好了」"
